# Draft rule for network-intrusion-analysis-natureforce. Tested on a synthetic pcap and on the real exercise pcap (see detections/README.md).
# Observed behaviour: GET for an .exe with User-Agent curl/8.21.0 to an external host on TCP 9000 (frame 23091).
alert http $HOME_NET any -> $EXTERNAL_NET !$HTTP_PORTS (msg:"LAB Possible curl download of Windows executable on non-standard port"; flow:established,to_server; http.method; content:"GET"; http.user_agent; content:"curl/"; startswith; http.uri; content:".exe"; endswith; fast_pattern; classtype:trojan-activity; reference:url,www.malware-traffic-analysis.net; metadata:created_at 2026_11_05, mitre_technique_id T1105, mitre_technique_id T1571; sid:9005001; rev:1;)
